  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[NoPollution.NoPollution.Mod.Setting.NoiseMultiplier]": "設定噪音污染倍率。基準值與預設值皆為 100。0 表示無噪音污染倍率",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[NoPollution.NoPollution.Mod.Setting.NoisePollutionNotificationLimit]": "如果噪音污染對幸福度的影響低於此值，將會顯示通知。基準值與預設值皆為 -7。",
